<p>A collection of individual assignments and collaborative projects completed at <strong>PolyU</strong>, bringing together software engineering, machine learning, data visualization and computer networking.</p>
<h2>✨ Featured Projects</h2>
<h3>🎲 <a href="https://github.com/KingstonZhu0711/PolyU-Courses/tree/main/COMP%203211%20Software%20Engineering/Project/Command-line-based-Monopoly-Game">Command-Line Monopoly Game</a></h3>
<p><strong>COMP 3211 · Software Engineering</strong>  
<img alt="Java" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Java-E76F00?style=flat-square"> <img alt="Maven" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Maven-C71A36?style=flat-square"> <img alt="JUnit" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/JUnit-25A162?style=flat-square"></p>
<p>A group project with customizable property names, prices and rents, game saving and loading, and separate model, view and controller components. Includes unit tests, design diagrams and a user manual.</p>
<hr>
<h3>🧠 <a href="https://github.com/KingstonZhu0711/PolyU-Courses/tree/main/DSAI%204203%20MACHINE%20LEARNING/Individual_Project/dont-overfit-ii">Don’t Overfit II — Classification Experiments</a></h3>
<p><strong>DSAI 4203 · Machine Learning</strong>  
<img alt="Python" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3776AB?style=flat-square"> <img alt="pandas" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/pandas-150458?style=flat-square"> <img alt="NumPy" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/NumPy-013243?style=flat-square"> <img alt="scikit-learn" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/scikit--learn-F7931E?style=flat-square"> <img alt="XGBoost" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/XGBoost-7C3AED?style=flat-square"></p>
<p>An individual project exploring regularized logistic regression, recursive feature elimination, random forests, and voting and stacking ensembles. Includes ROC-AUC evaluation code and prediction exports for submission.</p>
<hr>
<h3>📊 <a href="https://github.com/KingstonZhu0711/PolyU-Courses/tree/main/DSAI%204203%20MACHINE%20LEARNING/Group_Project">Australian News Topic Visualization</a></h3>
<p><strong>DSAI 4203 · Machine Learning</strong>  
<img alt="Python" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3776AB?style=flat-square"> <img alt="pandas" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/pandas-150458?style=flat-square"> <img alt="Plotly" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Plotly-3F4F75?style=flat-square"></p>
<p>Part of a group project exploring Australian news headlines from 2003–2021. Uses keyword-based topic labels and monthly aggregation to visualize changes over time, with interactive charts and a PNG export.</p>
<hr>
<h3>🌐 <a href="https://github.com/KingstonZhu0711/PolyU-Courses/tree/main/Comp%202322%20Computer%20Networking/ZhuJinShun_22101071d_COMP2322_Project">HTTP Client and Web Server</a></h3>
<p><strong>COMP 2322 · Computer Networking</strong>  
<img alt="Python" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3776AB?style=flat-square"> <img alt="TCP sockets" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/TCP_sockets-0891B2?style=flat-square"></p>
<p>A socket-based client/server project implementing GET and HEAD requests, local file serving, response headers, error responses and request logging. Includes a command-line client and setup notes.</p>
<hr>
<h2>🚀 Getting Started</h2>
<p>Folders are organized by course, with project code, assignments, reports and other course materials stored in their respective subfolders. The highlights above link directly to selected project folders; browse the repository for the wider collection.</p>
<p>Each project has its own setup requirements. Refer to the available instructions and source files, and adjust local paths, network addresses and dataset locations as needed. Some datasets and dependencies must be obtained separately.</p>
<h2>📚 Academic Integrity</h2>
<p>This collection is shared for portfolio and learning purposes. If you are taking a related course, use it to understand approaches and develop your own solutions. Do not submit this work as your own.</p>
